; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Peripheral.c	   827   \DESCRIPTION    Pass pointer to validation function.
; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Peripheral.c	   828   \COUNTERMEASURE \N Called validation function checks whether Address is in the range of the given Peripheral Region.
; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Peripheral.c	   829                      There is no precondition for parameter Address. The validation function does neither write nor read
; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Peripheral.c	   830                      to the given Address.
